&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>NOTESI</title><link>https://khalid9assi.com/projects/notesi/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Jun 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://khalid9assi.com/projects/notesi/</guid><description>Grades Management System for Students</description></item><item><title>ESIHUB</title><link>https://khalid9assi.com/projects/esihub/</link><pubDate>Thu, 12 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://khalid9assi.com/projects/esihub/</guid><description>Academic Resource Hub</description></item><item><title>Resume</title><link>https://khalid9assi.com/resume/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://khalid9assi.com/resume/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Useful links !</title><link>https://khalid9assi.com/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://khalid9assi.com/links/</guid><description>&lt;div class="hn-list"&gt;
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
